                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]Wayyyyy too short[/h1]\n\nThis is a very short VN with some choices. As far as I'm aware, there are 3 different endings. It took me a little over 20 minutes to get all of them. There just is [i][b]way too little content[/b][/i] for this to be a paid game. The entire story was over even before I managed to get into it, and the lack of character development failed to make the story interesting enough. No cards or achievements either.\n\n[h1]实在太短了[/h1]\n\n20多分钟就拿到所有的结局。故事太简单也不怎么有趣，内容太少，缺乏深度。这游戏应该免费才对。也没有卡或成就。",
